### POST login and create token
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob10",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### POST for register user
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob800",
  "password": "1234"
}

### POST create modification for car by car id
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/cars/60/modifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nye bremser",
  "category": "REPAIR",
  "date": "2026-10-07",
  "cost": 2500,
  "description": "Nye for- og bagbremser"
}

### POST create expense
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/expenses/60/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-07",
  "category": "FUEL",
  "amount": 600,
  "description": "Tanket bilen"
}

### PUT update expense for car
PUT http://localhost:7070/api/v1/expenses/car/60/update/100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
